window.products.push({"id":208079,"name":"OdorStop OS2500UV2 Professional Grade Ozone Generator/UV Air Purifier for Areas of 2500 Square Feet+, For Deodorizing and Purifying Medium Occupied Sp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613fo-+LQgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🛑 TREATMENT AREA OF 2500 SQUARE FEET+: The OS2500UV2 is a revolutionary new product and the only combination ozone generator and UV air cleaner. It can be used to eliminate even the most severe odors, even in occupied spaces! To accomplish this innovation, we took our top rated UV model and added an “off” option to the variable ozone output, an extra 254 NM UV-C bulb, and a charcoal filter - features never before used on an ozone air purifier! 🛑 PATENTED DESIGN AND TECHNOLOGY: The OS2500UV2 is lightweight (15 lbs), has an amazing 300 CFM fan, 2 high-output 254 NM UV-C Bulbs, a charcoal filter, a variable ozone output (none to 1800mg/h), a 12-hour timer with a “hold” option, and the 2 ozone plates can be cleaned without taking the unit apart. A breakthrough in ozone technology and the only professional grade ozone generator that can be used in occupied spaces. Product measurements: 13 x 10 x 11 inches, 13lbs. 🛑 TOP RATED FOR A REASON: OdorStop continues to set the standard in the ozone industry with innovative concepts and designs. With more than 15 models to choose from, we have a model for every odor and deodorizing need. OdorStop is patented (US D887,982 S), trademarked, and trusted! Replacement Ozone Plates - OSOP2; Filters - OSFM (white) and OSUV2CF (charcoal). 🛑 BUYER’S BEWARE: Many companies grossly exaggerate ozone output and treatment areas, knowing customers have no ability to verify their overstated claims. Also, some do not have a presence in the U.S., a stated warranty, or any customer service at all. 🛑 CUSTOMER SATISFACTION IS OUR #1 PRIORITY: OdorStop is a U.S. company with a 24-hour customer service hotline and a website with instructional videos. We offer a 5-year warranty and a 30-day money back guarantee! Amazon Policy prohibits the sale of all ozone products to California. Ozone is for use in UNOCCUPIED spaces only. EPA Est. No. 94721-CHN-1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613fo-+LQgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OdorStop","source_asin":"B0BSR6YD3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSR6YD3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSR6YD3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
