window.products.push({"id":208160,"name":"Art Wall 'Gang of Pears' Wrapped Canvas Art by Susi Franco, 20 by 28-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b2AaBxcxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Susi Franco 'Gang of Pears' unwrapped canvas is a vibrant, bold abstract piece of still life depicting three beautiful pears. A great focal point for any home or office. The first third of Susi's life was spent as a professional jazz vocalist & fashion model, touring the country; after the births of her first 3 children, they toured with her until the oldest became school age, then she limited performance regionally to New England. Realizing she'd be raising her children alone after a divorce, Susi enrolled in Nursing College and became an RN, working in that profession for over 23 years until she retired. After her retirement she found a new passion, Painting and began voraciously studying everything related to painting she could lay hands on. Since that time, Susi has gone on to win three international awards for her work; her work now hangs in four countries as well as a museum in Durango, Mexico. She was selected to contribute work to the popular TV show 'Extreme Makeover: Home Edition' for their Warwick, RI project and has been the subject of many New England regional newspaper & magazine articles as well as cable TV show appearances. Her work is featured annually on RI's PBS TV Art Auction; she won 'Most Inspirational Woman' award from her appearance on the cable TV show 'Tea With Marie' and contributes artwork to multiple charities yearly. She exhibits both locally and regionally and sells her one-of-a-kind Fine Jewelry in a Wick ford, RI boutique. Giving discarded objects ( such as blocks of wood from construction sites, old wooden windows, tin ceiling tiles etc.) new life as artwork is an Art sub-specialty Ms. Franco particularly enjoys & commits significant time to.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b2AaBxcxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B00D7CJSEW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D7CJSEW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D7CJSEW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208161,"name":"Beistle Hanukkah Cutout Decorations-3 Pcs, Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813yPUWRm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beistle 22416 Hanukkah Cutouts (3 Count). The package contains 3 cutouts in different designs. The designs include a Star of David, a dreidel and a menorah. The cutouts are printed on both sides of board stock and measure 10 Inch. Hang these great cutouts up on a wall or in a window to decorate for Hanukkah!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813yPUWRm8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beistle","source_asin":"B006TSS7P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006TSS7P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006TSS7P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208162,"name":"Soon Global Ceramic Soap Dish, Soap Holder Self Draining, Leaf Shaped Soap Tray for Bathroom/Kitchen/Counter/Shower (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B3KF+Aw7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Top-Quality Materials and Finishing: Our ceramic leaf-shaped soap dish boasts top-notch materials and finishing that guarantee quality and durability. We use premium ceramic material known for its toughness, non-toxicity, and ease of cleaning. Additionally, the ceramic material is resistant to moisture, making it suitable for use in high humidity environments like bathrooms. Our product is not only practical and durable but also aesthetically pleasing. The combination of high-quality ceramic clay and a glossy glaze finish creates a shiny, classy-looking soap dish that will complement any bathroom decor. You can trust that our soap dish will maintain its shine and beauty even after prolonged use. Self-draining mechanism: By incorporating this self-draining feature, we have ensured that your soap stays dry and lasts longer, avoiding the problem of mushy soap. This is an essential feature that distinguishes our soap dish from others on the market and guarantees that your soap remains fresh and usable for longer. Wide Application: Our ceramic leaf-shaped soap dish is not just a practical bathroom accessory; it is also a beautiful decorative piece that adds a touch of luxury and harmony to any space. Its elegant design and glossy finish make it an eye-catching addition to any bathroom or kitchen. The versatility of our soap dish allows it to be used in a variety of settings. Whether you choose to place it in the bathroom, kitchen, or on a countertop, our soap dish will complement your decor perfectly. You can enjoy the luxury and practicality of our soap dish wherever you need it. Astonishing Design: Our ceramic leaf-shaped soap dish boasts a concise profile and clean, luxurious design language that adds an aesthetic appeal to any bathroom decor. The bionic shape, inspired by the lotus leaf, is a beautiful and unique feature that sets our soap dish apart from others on the market. The elegant and sophisticated design is sure to impress anyone who appreciates a touch of elegance in their bathroom. We understand that our customers expect a hassle-free shopping experience, which is why we offer a comprehensive return policy that puts your satisfaction first. With our 24-hour professional customer service, you can have peace of mind knowing that any questions or concerns you have will be promptly addressed by our friendly and knowledgeable staff.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B3KF+Aw7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soon Global","source_asin":"B0BB2ZCY1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB2ZCY1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB2ZCY1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208163,"name":"OBR KING Glass Salad Bowl with Gold Trim 72 oz Irregular Mixing Bowl Large Serving Bowls for Serving Fruit Nut Pasta Popcorn Chips Candy and Snack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iwRqXlY6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Clear Salad Bowls】 The salad bowl is made of high quality glass, stylish and durable. It is not recommended to suddenly overheat and overcold during use, as this may cause the glass bowls to crack or break. And hand washing is recommended as dishwasher washing may cause the gold trim to wear off. 【Large Serving Bowl for Your Family】 This glass serving bowl measures approximately 9inch in diameter (top) tapered to 5.9inch at the base, and 2.95~4.1inch tall. Capacity of approximately 72 oz(2140ml). Ideal size for entertaining your friends or family. 【Multi-purpose Glass Bowl】 Suitable for serving salads, fruits, nuts, vegetables, pasta, desserts, snacks, chips, candy, etc. Ideal for Family Reunions, Catering, Food Service, Picnics, Weddings, Parties, Celebration, Restaurant, Buffet and daily use. It can also be a great birthday, housewarming, Christmas and Thanksgiving gift for your friends and family. 【Extra Points for Your Tableware】 The gold trim lines the irregular edge, making it different from traditional salad bowls, more stylish, elegant and eye-catching. It's a nice decorative bowl whether in your kitchen or at weddings, parties, birthdays and any event. 【Exquisite Craftsmanship】 The hammered texture on the outside of the bowl provides a good grip while handling, pouring, mixing, or cleaning. And its texture makes it look sparkling in the light or sunlight, not only to decorate your food, table and kitchen, but also to bring appetite to you and your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iwRqXlY6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBR KING","source_asin":"B099F22T5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099F22T5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099F22T5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
