window.products.push({"id":208278,"name":"Smartware Silicone Loaf Pan, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E2FebOl+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Smartware bakeware transfers heat more efficiently than conventional pans-that's why the best pastry chefs in Europe have relied on it for years. Smartware bakeware heats evenly and cools quickly. Even heat transfer means everything you cook and bake-from bread to lasagna, roasts to fresh cookies-will cook more evenly. You'll eliminate hot spots and cold spots. Everything you cook will have better results every time. You can store it in the fridge or freezer, use it in the oven or microwave and it is always dishwasher safe. Also, Smartware bakeware allows you to use less fat and oil when you cook, lowering calories and increasing flavor. Now that's smart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E2FebOl+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smartware","source_asin":"B004B3O8SM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004B3O8SM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004B3O8SM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208279,"name":"Mit & Mia Personalized Tumbler Photo Song Lyrics Valentines Day Gift For Husband On Anniversary Travel Tumbler With Straw Custom Photo Wedding Anniver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JD-5CUv+L._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"OCCASION: personalized tumblers with lids are suitable for many different occasions such as Birthday, Wedding Anniversary, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Graduation, Christmas, Halloween, and Valentine's Day. We have various designs of tumbler straw for you to choose from. Upload a photo matching the design of your choice to preview the “custom tumbler”. GIFTS FOR WHO: Customized song lyrics tumbler with lid with your favorite commemorative photo to dedicate to him/her, mom/dad, sisters/friend, daughter/son… Meaningful lyrics instead of the love you send to the loved one. They can use the tumbler to hold the iced coffee tumbler or hot coffee tumbler. iced coffee cup are very convenient to take to work, travel, and put in the car… MATERIAL: tumbler with lid can prevent leakage and water spillage. The coffee mug is made of high-quality stainless steel with high durability. The coffee tumbler is rated as very good insulation, can keep hot for 3 hours and cold for 9 hours. The mug's body is made of 18/8 stainless steel, so the metal tumblers with lids are not only durable but also won't change the taste of your drink. UTILITIES: metal tumblers with lids have a compact design that fits in the hand, easy to carry iced coffee tumbler or insulated travel mugs for hot to work or picnic. The transparent tumbler cup lid is BPA-free, helping to keep the cup mouth tight. The outstanding advantage of the large thermal cup is that water does not spill from the lid, drip or condense outside, ensuring that the steel metal cups are always dry. The coffee tumbler with straw is powder-coated, so the photo will not fade. EASY TO CARRY: the iced coffee tumbler or hot coffee tumbler is light, compact, and retains heat well, making it easy to carry drinks when going out. With its clever design, the travel coffee mug spill proof fits easily in the car or in a backpack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JD-5CUv+L._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mit & Mia","source_asin":"B0BC1GCWKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC1GCWKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC1GCWKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208280,"name":"PureFit Wrap Around Ruffled Bed Skirt with Adjustable Elastic Belt - 18 Inch Drop Easy to Put On, Wrinkle Free Bedskirt Dust Ruffles, Bed Frame Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yrvRQJ9BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elastic A PERFECT FIT: The PureFit dust Ruffle bed shirt is designed to be a perfect fit for your Queen and King sizes beds thanks to the built-in adjustable elastic strap. The bed skirt measures 60\"x80\"x18\". This multi-layer ruffle bed skirt is available in 23 beautiful and fade resistant colors LUXURIOUS SILKY SATIN LIKE MICROFIBER FABRIC: This King and Queen size ruffled bed skirt is made from 100 percent silky satin-like microfiber fabric softly shirred for a romantic yet tailored look. The fabric is dust and stain resistant, wrinkle free and extremely soft and smooth SUPER EASY TO PUT ON, DESIGNED TO FIT: Featuring a platform-free easy wrap around stretch & elastic adjustable construction, you can easily put this bed skirt on and off by yourself without lifting the mattress. This PureFit bed skirt fits Queen and King size mattresses A GENEROUS 18-INCH DROP LENGTH: The dust ruffle/bed skirt has a generous drop of 18-inches length, reaches the floor easily and hides any under the bed storage, hides misshapen box springs, bed frames and bedposts, deflects dust and particles that might otherwise collect underneath your bed or simply to give your bed a uniform and sleek look EASY CARE : Machine washable bed skirt, wash with like colors, gentle cycle, use only non-chlorine bleach, if needed, tumble dry low, Warm iron as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yrvRQJ9BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureFit","source_asin":"B07V696CHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V696CHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V696CHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
