window.products.push({"id":208288,"name":"Lelabom Wood Lift Top Coffee Table with Hidden Compartment, Lift Tabletop and Push-Pull Countertops Dining Table for Home Living Room, Office, Retro B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616ZkDxtSIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Lift-top Ergonomic Design】: The tabletop of this coffee table can be effortlessly elevated to a comfortable height to create a spacious workspace or dining surface while you’re sitting on the sofa. The heavy-duty metal mechanism allows smooth and easy operation. 【Storage Space Master】: A hidden storage compartment beneath the top keeps your everyday items like laptop, remote controllers, game controllers handy and dirt-free. The spacious open shelf holds storage blankets, books, snacks and knick-knacks just fine.And enlarge your space and keep all your things handy and organized. 【Sturdy & Durable Structure】: High quality spring hinges system enables the tabletop to be lifted up or lowered down effortlessly and noiselessly. MDF board and metal frame ensure stability and durability for years of use. A custom waterproof tabletop that's heat-resistant, dust-free, and keeps clean with just a damp cloth. 【Unique Design】: This multifunctional lift coffee table is suitable for both living room and bedroom. Can be applied to any decoration style environment. It is very suitable for you who are looking for fashion and practicality. 【Hassle-free Assembly】: Comes with all necessary hardware and an illustrated instruction manual to help you set up this lift-top coffee table quickly and without difficulties. 【Assemble Tips】:Put the screws in loosely until all pieces are together and then go back and tighten them all.Any assemble problem please feel free to contact Lelabom customer service. Lelabom has been committed to providing customers with the most satisfactory furniture and services. Any question before and after purchase, please contact us and we will find solution for you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616ZkDxtSIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lelabom","source_asin":"B09QM9LHR1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QM9LHR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QM9LHR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
