window.products.push({"id":208366,"name":"HAWK IMPORTERS, INC Jewel Tool Universal Brass Clock Key Winder Set | 2 Piece Set Includes Odd Even Numbers | Great for Windig Grandfather Clocks, Ant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U+IjPZdaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Jewel Tool Universal Brass Clock Key Winder Set is a 2-piece set of high-quality clock keys designed to fit most clocks with odd or even numbered keyholes. The set includes a size 5 key with an even number and a size 7 key with an odd number. Specs can be found below: 5 PRONG EVEN SIZES : 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 || 2.75 mm 7/64 in (2); 3.25 mm 1/8 in (4); 3.75 mm 5/16 in (6); 4.25 mm 11/64 in (8); 4.75 mm 3/16 in (10). 5 PRONG ODD SIZES : 3, 5, 7, 9, 11 || 3 mm 1/8 in (3); 3.5 mm 9/64 in (5); 4 mm 5/32 in (7); 4.5 mm (9) and 5 mm 13/64 in (11).These clock keys are made from solid brass, which ensures their durability and longevity. Brass is a corrosion-resistant and sturdy material that can withstand the test of time. The keys are beautifully polished and feature a sleek and classic design that will complement any clock. The Jewel Tool Universal Brass Clock Key Winder Set is ideal for winding most types of clocks, including antique clocks, grandfather clocks, mantle clocks, and cuckoo clocks. They are easy to use and provide a smooth and easy winding experience. The keys fit comfortably in your hand, and the size markings are easy to read for quick identification. This set of clock keys is perfect for clock enthusiasts, watchmakers, and professionals who repair and maintain clocks. The two keys in this set cover most clock sizes and types, so you won't need to purchase additional keys to cover different sizes. In summary, the Jewel Tool Universal Brass Clock Key Winder Set is a high-quality and durable set of clock keys designed to fit most clocks with odd or even numbered keyholes. These keys are made from solid brass and have a classic design that will complement any clock. Whether you're a clock enthusiast or a professional watchmaker, this set of clock keys is an essential tool for winding and maintaining your clocks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U+IjPZdaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAWK IMPORTERS, INC","source_asin":"B000YHSZCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000YHSZCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000YHSZCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
