window.products.push({"id":208381,"name":"CORKAS Portable Handheld Fan, 3-in-1 USB Desk Fan with 4 Speeds and 4000mAh Rechargeable Battery, 6-31 Hours Working Time, Quiet Operation, Mini Perso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NJo3ntjtS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Rechargeable 4000mAh Handheld Fan】Our small fan has a built-in 4000mAh battery, which can be used continuously for about 31 hours (level 1) after being fully charged. The usage time of each air volume is about 20 hours for level 2, 11 hours for level 3, and 6 hours for level 4. It can be used daily. 【Four Level Adjustable Speed Portable Fan】After equipped this mini fan with 4 levels of air volume mode, you can freely adjust according to your preferences and needs. Levels 1 to 2 reproduce soft natural breezes in weak breeze mode and breeze mode, ultra-quiet, and can be easily used at work or in the library. Levels 3 to 4 provide powerful blowing in medium and strong wind modes, which can quickly eliminate the sultry heat, making it ideal for outdoor activities and watching sports. 【Smartphone rechargeable USB fan】Corkas battery operated fan supports standard USB port and multiple charging methods. In addition, it has a built-in 4000mAh battery, which can be used as a mobile battery for smartphones. For those who want to carry a portable fan or portable charger with them, but want to reduce the luggage as much as possible, this mini fan is your best choice. 【2 Type Personal Fan】A hand-held fan that can be used for school commuting. Lightweight and compact design, easy to carry. With a dedicated bracket, this fan can also be used as a stationary desk fan. It saves space, so you can install it as your personal fan in any place you like, such as a table or desk in the living room. 【Safety and Quiet Mini Fan】You can safely use 9 kinds of safety protection circuit designs, such as back electromotive force, overcharge, overheat, overpower, overcurrent, short circuit, overdischarge, prevent reverse voltage, prevent overheating temperature sensor function. The patented turbo fan blade design can feel the quiet and natural wind. In addition, the small mesh protective net makes children use it with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NJo3ntjtS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORKAS","source_asin":"B09XQ9CNH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XQ9CNH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XQ9CNH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
