window.products.push({"id":208388,"name":"Sister Picture Frame Personalized 4x6 Photo Engraved Keepsake Colorful Stained Glass Décor J Devlin Pic 391 EP570 (4x6 horizontal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ITMeKUDoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized gifts make lifetime keepsakes! For a gift with the extra touch of thoughtfulness custom engrave this picture frame for your sister. Add a photo of you together to commemorate a special event or just as a reminder of that special bond. You may use our suggested layout or be creative with your own message. Lettering will be engraved and will appear in white frost on the clear glass. The 4x6 photo is surrounded by a combination of clears, purple, green and peach stained glass. Triangular glass sides and base support the photo frame adding stability and style unique to J Devlin. Ascetically pleasing from all angles, photos are easily inserted into the back. This handcrafted stained glass frame has been made with lead free solder to protect you and the environment. The metal trim and solder have been antiqued with a charcoal patina and a wax applied keeping the frame beautiful for years to come. Polish with a soft dry cloth if necessary. Each picture frame is carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans using a copper foil and solder technique developed by Louis Comfort Tiffany in the late 1800’s. This age-old art form combined with 21st century designs creates the perfect combination for unique home décor. All designs are J Devlin originals…enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ITMeKUDoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Devlin Glass Art","source_asin":"B082TMDYYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082TMDYYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082TMDYYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208389,"name":"Fair Trade Ghana Bolga African Medium Yikene Tote 12-15\" Across, 65841","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kDCbbSZbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"You will receive a basket of nearly identical colors to this one pictured, but please keep in mind every basket is uniquely handwoven and differs in design. These baskets come from Yikene village in the Bolgatanga area of Ghana, and are a new mini version of the Yikene totes . They are traditionally used for carrying goods to and from the market. This is the Yikene interpretation of the regular 2 handled shoppers. Weavers in the region use the abundant Veta vera grass to weave these incredibly hardy, useful baskets. Easily reshape your basket by quickly submerging in water, reshape by hand and let basket dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kDCbbSZbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baskets of Africa","source_asin":"B079YWPW5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079YWPW5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079YWPW5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208390,"name":"Zulay Premium Apple Corer - Easy to Use Durable Apple Corer Remover for Pears, Bell Peppers, Fuji, Honeycrisp, Gala and Pink Lady Apples - Stainless S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M5jhpTZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"So Easy To Use - It Will Blow You Away!: Stainless Steel Twin Blades with sharp, serrated tips designed to smoothly core through any apple, pears, bell peppers, cupcakes and more. After coring your fruits and vegetables the blades simply open-up and dump the unwanted core for convenient disposal. Making this beautiful corer one of the most useful tools in any kitchen. Super Durable and Fun: Sturdy high quality stainless steel blades that will not easily bend or break will allow you to core through any apple with ease. This heavy duty corer can be also be used as a pitter and seed remover. It is a very useful tool that will last you a long time. 100% Rust proof. Smooth Ergonomic Handle: The beautiful handle is molded to give you a super comfortable and steady grip. The non-slip design makes coring easy and fun. It can be comfortably held and used by seniors and those with arthritic hands. Very Easy To Clean: Unlike other corers and slicers, this unique twin-blade apple cutter has a lever that will easily open, making it very easy to clean with a quick rinse. You can also put it in the dishwasher for a more thorough cleaning. Speeds Up Food Prepping: You will be amazed by the ease and speed with which you will core fruits and veggies compared to other apple cutters, pitters, dividers, wedger, huller, corerslicer, progressive slicer, divider and cheap plastic accessories. This prime apple, potato, onion, tomato, pineapple, zuchinni and pear corer is the best way to go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M5jhpTZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B082XHW3KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082XHW3KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082XHW3KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
