window.products.push({"id":208442,"name":"Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Olive Oil Sprayer, 5 In 1 Oil Dispenser Bottle For Kitchen, Glass Cooking Oil Dispenser With Oil brush Diy Stickers Pen And C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VP92uh8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【Multifunctional 5-in-1 Design】What will you get? 200Ml glass oil container*1 silicone oil brush*1 DIY sticker*6 pen*1 cleaning brush*1. The silicone oil brush can withstand high temperatures of 250 degrees Celsius and can evenly spread food. At the same time, it is equipped with DIY stickers, which can identify the name of the bottled liquid. In addition, it is also equipped with a cleaning brush with a length of about 20cm. ❤【Healthy Eating & Precise Oil Control】This kitchen oil dispenser bottle uses mist oil instead of pouring, always dispensing 0.2 teaspoon (1g) per mist. To prevent overuse of oil, vertical and horizontal fan sprays achieve the best coverage and spread evenly on the food surface. 99% of the oil drains without wasting a single drop of oil. Eat healthier by reducing your fat intake while enjoying delicious food. ❤【High Quality Material】We use food grade glass material, which is resistant to high temperature. The dust-proof atomizing nozzle is hidden inside the cover, effectively keeping it clean, and can be directly and safely used for various edible oils and other liquid seasonings, such as vinegar, cooking wine, soy sauce, water, etc. The transparent dispenser and DIY stickers make it easy to know the status of the oil, and it is easy to quickly identify the seasoning (oil/vinegar/sauce). ❤【Easy to Use】The design of this cooking oil sprayer is very simple for anyone, the measuring bottle itself is large, it can easily and quickly refill the oil without an extra funnel. The trigger design is ingenious, allowing you to easily press and cook with ease. This lubricator is a convenient bottle that you can operate with just one hand, just by pumping a few times quickly as needed, you can evenly coat the oil mist on your food. ❤【Wide Application】Glass Oil Dropper Bottle is the perfect tool for home and kitchen. Glass oil bottles can hold most types of oils and diluted liquid sauces. Widely used in outdoor barbecue, kitchen cooking. The silicone brush can also be used on its own, making it easy to apply ketchup, chocolate sauce. Can be used for salad making, cooking, baking, grilling, frying and more. You can also use them to water houseplants and to spray alcohol and water to clean kitchens and furniture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VP92uh8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handwith","source_asin":"B0B215T8RS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B215T8RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B215T8RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
