window.products.push({"id":208447,"name":"Morebes Paisley Floral Area Rug, 3x5 Boho Chic Entry Rug Soft Machine Washable Laundry Bedside Non-Slip Accent Mat,Blue Gray Indoor Floor Carpet for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DqnGNEy6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Paisley Floral Design]: The boho chic area rug from features intricate floral design in neutral, trendy framed by a matching border, blends gray with pops of blue, offers a chic, stylish update for any room in your. [Safety non-slip rug]: The bottom of the indoor carpet is made of TPR material, which keeps the carpet to grip the floor without the need for additional carpet pads, reducing the risk of tripping. [Soft Throw Rug]: Soft faux wool rug creates a plush underfoot feeling that is suitable for everyday use.Made of a dense, cut pile fiber with floral print which are durable comfortable as well as not easy to shedding. [Wide application]: The floral collection area rug can be placed in any traditional, formal, or classic interior. Suitable for high-traffic areas like living room, dining room, kitchen, foyer, entryway, kid room, basement, mudroom, etc. [Easy Clean]: Machine washable for daily easy care.It will not fade, shed, or shrink after you clean it several times. Vacuum cleaner not recommended due to the flexible backing, it may be caught by the roller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DqnGNEy6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Morebes","source_asin":"B09N32LWFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N32LWFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N32LWFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208448,"name":"Silicone Trivet Set of 4 – Heat-Resistant Trivets for Hot Pots and Pans – Multipurpose Silicone Trivet Mat, Drying Rack, Jar Opener – Thick Non-Slip S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rEniGH-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tonmidej specializes in providing practical and convenient kitchen and home accessories meant to make your chores and day-to-day activities easier and more enjoyable. We rely on high-quality materials, trustworthy suppliers and innovative designs to create modern solutions and handy accessories that will never disappoint in terms of durability and aesthetics. Should you not be entirely pleased with your purchase, our customer care department is at your disposal and will address any issues or concerns!  Silicone Trivets for Hot Pans and Pots – The Ideal Solution for Protecting Your Tables  Our silicone trivet is a simple kitchen accessory designed with your comfort and convenience in mind. Made with heat-resistant, food-grade silicone, these pot holders are thick, durable and resistant to the warmth of hot pans, pots and dishes taken right out of the oven or microwave, whose purpose is to protect your table and countertop against stains or burn marks. The silicone trivets are super flexible and versatile, so you can also use them as coasters, jar openers, or utensils rests.  Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product:  100% food-grade silicone; Eco-friendly material; Durable and thick; Heat-resistant; Dishwasher and freezer safe; Safe to use in the microwave or oven; Protect against spills, leaks, food drops, stains, and burns marks; Easy to clean and maintain; Non-slip and reliable; Dimensions: 7.2 x 7.2 x 0.22-inch; Convenient Blue - set of 4;  Protect your tables with our silicone trivets for hot pans and pots!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rEniGH-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tonmidej","source_asin":"B076F69SS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076F69SS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076F69SS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208449,"name":"Sitram Profiserie 0.6-Quart Professional Saucepan with Pour Spout","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WX11N3K9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Sitram Sitram France has produced professional grade cookware for over 40 years. It is favored by many of the world's top executive chefs and restaurants. We're glad to have Sitram available in the U.S. Why do so many professionals around the world favor Sitram cookware? Sitram cookware is made in France, designed for commercial use. The factory is fully aware of the highest expectations that executive chefs place in their equipment, and continuously works with them to provide nothing but the best. Why would you want professional cookware? Oh, where do we start! How about \"these pots and pans are virtually indestructible as well as dishwasher safe\"? There's more: To pour drip-free, simply push the lever. Releasing the lever re-seals it. For easy filling and cleaning, the attached lid opens all the way. Both lines offered here, Catering and Profiserie , are made of highest quality 18/10 stainless steel to guarantee even heat distribution. Since the base is composed of three thick layers of sturdy metal, they will never warp, yet Sitram cookware heats up quickly and retains heat extremely well. Needless to say, Sitram's surgical-steel grade material won't discolor or alter the flavor of foods. Users around the world praise how smooth the interior remains even after years of rigid use. The handles are multiple spot welded to provide superior durability and easy cleaning. The lids feature a small hole to vent: While it keeps liquids and flavors in, it lets just a tiny amount of steam out so that the lid doesn't vibrate top of a boiling pot. All pots, pans and lids are dishwasher safe, NSF* certified and come with a limited lifetime warranty. Catering versus Profiserie Catering boasts a thick copper core sandwiched between two layers of 18/10 stainless steel. Copper allows for a higher cooking temperature, perfectly even heat distribution, and a quick response time to temperature changes. The grooved handles are the hallmark of commercial-grade cookware.Catering withstands temperatures up to 1800F and can be used on gas, electric, or ceramic stove-tops. Oven-safe (please use oven mitts). Profiserie has an extra thick aluminum disk sandwiched between 18/10 stainless steel and comes with comfort grip stay-cool tubular handles. Profiserie can be used on gas, electric, ceramic, or induction stove-tops. Oven-safe (please use oven mitts). For your convenience, all Sitram pieces are available \"open stock\". Sitram does not force you into buying cookware sets to include items/sizes you don't need. Get exactly what you need - not more, not less, and enjoy it for a lifetime. Let Sitram become your trusted partner in your kitchen. Bon Appétit! *NSF Founded in 1944, NSF International is committed to protecting and improving human health on a global scale. NSF International is an independent, not-for-profit organization that provides standards development, product certification, auditing, education and risk management for public health and the environment. Manufacturers, regulators and consumers alike look to NSF International for the development of public health standards and certification that help protect the world's food, water, health and consumer products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WX11N3K9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sitram","source_asin":"B00009A9W7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009A9W7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009A9W7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
