window.products.push({"id":208485,"name":"ArtCreativity Western Pick Candles, Set of 4, Cowboy Themed Birthday Cake Candles, Birthday Party Supplies and Decorations, Cake Topper, Cupcake Toppe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712B1omTOcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"THE PERFECT CANDLES FOR THAT WESTERN-THEMED PARTY Spruce Things Up  Inspire wonder-filled ‘ooooohs!’ and ‘aaaaahs!’ when that birthday party reaches cake o’clock! Perfect for western-themed parties, these birthday cake candles are a memorable way to crown the occasion. Every set comes with 4 candles with assorted designs. Measuring 3” tall, these candles aren’t limited to cakes. Use them to decorate cupcakes and muffins and spark glee whenever you bring out those pastries. Quality You’ll Love No dealing with a flame that keeps dying out in the middle of the birthday song. We’ve used a combination of high-quality wax and wicks to ensure the candles stay alight until the birthday boy or girl finally blows them out. And just like all of ArtCreativity products, our western candles are crafted with uncompromising quality in mind. The non-toxic plastic stakes mean you can decorate that cake with compliment-sparking goodness without any worries.Here’s why you’ll love these fun western candles:  - Come in a set of 4 to give you great value. - Beautiful look brings any western-themed party to life. - Made using high-quality, non-toxic materials for safe use. - Backed by a no-hassle, 100% money-back guarantee. Go ahead, get your candles and make that cowboy party one to remember!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712B1omTOcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtCreativity","source_asin":"B09D8H533P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D8H533P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D8H533P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
