window.products.push({"id":208546,"name":"Silicone Letter Mold for Chocolate 1Pcs, Large Letters Alphabet Mold for Cake Decorating, BPA Free Oven Safe Easy to Unmold and Clean, DIY Letter Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ra9U1GUPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🍪【BPA-free Food-Grade Material】In the process of silicone synthesis, platinum is used as a catalyst to obtain silicone with higher purity, more stable structure, and better performance. It is BPA-free and can be directly contacted with food, bringing you safe and reliable enjoyment. It can be put into the oven and is easy to use. 🍪【Large Size and Easy to demold】Pan Size - 13x8.9x1 inches. Letters size - 1 inch deep, 2 inches long, and 1-1.5 inches are wide. Thick and Flexible enough for you to take the letters out! Our mold has Good flexibility, Stretch it any way you want, making it easier for you to pop the chocolate out. 🍪【Easy to use and Clean】Our premium silicone letter mold has good stability and thermal conductivity, it will be heated evenly, not yellow or deform after long-term use. Rinse with water before and after use, dry quickly in a ventilated place, or dry with a clean soft cloth. In addition, 4 corners in our letter mold are designed with round holes, which is convenient for you to hang and store after use. 🍪【Oven Safe - Heat Resistant】The suitable temperature range of our silicone letter mold is -40°C ~ + 230°C ( -104°F ~ 446°F). It is super heat resistant and can be used repeatedly in the oven, microwave, dishwasher, and refrigerator. You can use our letter mold to make chocolates or cookies with your family or friends' names, for their Birthday or Festivals, or Anniversaries. 🍪【Long Service Life - Durable】Our chocolate letter mold is made by premium silicone, try not to use it at a temperature exceeding 230°C (446°F), and be careful not to use it with sharp knives and forks when putting it in the dishwasher to avoid scratching it. Then its service life is very very long!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ra9U1GUPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASISDAOZ","source_asin":"B09MD52JKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MD52JKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MD52JKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208547,"name":"rockflowerpaper Reusable Grocery Bags - Washable, Foldable, Packable Tote, Large Handles, Heavy Duty, Zippered Top Pouch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PwIV-d6xL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"100 % Polyester Polyester lining Zipper closure Machine Wash HEAVY DUTY CONSTRUCTION WITH LARGE CAPACITY: The perfect reusable bags for shopping! Whether the bags are being used for groceries, clothes or simply to carry your belongings, never think twice about being able to fit everything inside. The X-Large capacity (19” x 16” with a 9” handle drop) and 100% polyester construction make the bags capable of holding more than 50 pounds. The long handles allow you to effortlessly carry the bags on your shoulders no matter how heavy the bag gets. MACHINE WASHABLE & REUSABLE: Never worry about wasting time cleaning bags by hand, or needing to purchase more as all rockflowerpaper reusable shopping bags are machine washable and 100% reusable. Simply combine this reusable shopping bag with your regular wash and never think about the hassle of cleaning again. As an added bonus, the more you reuse each eco-friendly grocery tote, the more you'll reduce your carbon footprint. LIGHTWEIGHT AND FOLDABLE: Do you always forget to bring your reuseable bag when you go shopping for groceries? Never be without your reusable shopping bag again as each reusable bag is extremely lightweight, foldable into a miniscule 4.5\" x 5\" zipper pouch, and comes with a small clip to attach anywhere. Every tote was designed with the goal of being lightweight and foldable enough so that you won't even realize you're carrying around your reusable shopping bag. EXCLUSIVE SIGNATURE DESIGNS: Hate having the same bag as everyone else? Want your reusable bag to become a discussion point when you're shopping? Every purchase comes as a single reusable shopping bag with rockflowerpaper's own custom design. Each tote is made to stand out in a crowd. Match your style and personality throughout any daily activity, even if it's just shopping for groceries. DONATION TO OCEAN CONSERVANCY WITH EVERY PURCHASE: For every reusable shopping bag purchased, rockflowerpaper donates 20 cents to Ocean Conservancy, a nonprofit environmental advocacy group. Over the past 3 years, over $150,000 has been donated from purchases of blu bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PwIV-d6xL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"rockflowerpaper","source_asin":"B09DGN6BNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DGN6BNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DGN6BNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208548,"name":"Spinal Solution Wood Split Fully Assembled Bunkie Board for Mattress/Bed Support, Twin, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51juvKQXL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 1.5-inch Bunkie Board , Split Bunkie Board provides a surface foundation for any platform beds, bunks and daybeds. It adds support to the mattress and will keep mattress stay in good shape thus extending the life of your mattress. It will give a firm bottom support for the mattress and raises the mattress up for about 1.5 inches. When a mattress is placed directly on slats or metal spring, the mattress will have the tendency to rip or sink. These can be avoided with the use of a Bunkie board. Using a Bunkie board doubles the mattress' life expectancy. This Bunkie board is a good alternative in lieu of a box spring that may be too high for day beds. It will give the bed a lift without adding much height. This Bunkie board is strong enough to be used directly on bed frame in lieu of a box spring. It will give the mattress a lift which is a quite low but will definitely hold up the mattress. It is wrapped in a stitch bonded nonwoven fabric. It meets federal standards 1632 and 1633 fire code. This Bunkie Board will give you enduring comfort and durability for an excellent sleep. The split design will give you the convenience and easy mobility since the 2 piece varieties are very light weight utilizing 2 smaller pieces making them easier to carry and maneuver through the cramped quarters of an apartment our house. continuously aims to be the most reliable direct mattress manufacturer in the industry. With our prominent name and superior service, we satisfy customers all over. All of our products are made in the Country to ensure that you get only the best. We take great pride in the quality of our products and the quick service we provide. Our customers are our best advertisement. Customers and business partners alike have experienced Company's commitment to the unbeatable service we provide for their high quality products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51juvKQXL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spinal Solution","source_asin":"B0BDTLYJSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDTLYJSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDTLYJSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
