window.products.push({"id":208589,"name":"NTBAY 100% Brushed Microfiber King Duvet Cover Set, 3 Pieces Super Soft White Bedding Set, Solid Color Zipper Comforter Cover with Ties and 2 Pillow S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VY3KkM2ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT FEATURES: Made from nice quality brushed microfiber to provide exceptional softness and comfort. This soft duvet cover can ensure longer durability to last for years with better shrink resistant than cotton fabric. The hidden zipper easily allows you to insert and remove your duvet when needed. The four corner ties ensure that your comforter remains immovable in the cover. PRODUCT FUNCTION: Solid color design suits for your modern taste, bringing a simple and clean look. Our soft microfiber duvet cover set comes in a choice of color, offering timeless good looks and an easy pairing with styles both traditional and contemporary alike. Ideal for a master bedroom, guest room, or kid’s room, the durable microfiber duvet set offers affordable, stylish, everyday comfort. PACKAGE INCLUDE: Twin: 1 Duvet Cover: 68\"x90\" 1 Pillow Sham: 20\"x26\"+2\" Queen: 1 Duvet Cover: 90\"x90\" 2 Pillow Shams: 20\"x26\"+2\" King: 1 Duvet Cover: 104\"x 90\" 2 Pillow Shams: 20\"x36\"+2\" (Comforter is not included in the set) EASY CARE: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle, only non-chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry at low temperature, cool iron if needed. SATISFACTORY SALES SERVICE: We are so confident in the quality of our product that we offer 90 days return and replacement service. We also provide it with a life time free customer service. If you find that our products have quality problems, just contact us and we will solve the problem for you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VY3KkM2ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NTBAY","source_asin":"B07Y81GYDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y81GYDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y81GYDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":208590,"name":"Garlic Mincer,RYKKZ Mini Chopper Can Chop Several Cloves Of Garlic At Once,Quick And Easy To Operate,Very Suitable For Chopping Garlic,Chili, And Pean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q1X-SfreL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This multi-functional mini chopper, compared to the traditional garlic press：It can chop several cloves of garlic at once. It is easier to operate and requires less effort. Additionally, it is easy to clean.。It can also be used to chop many vegetables and spices such as onions, chili peppers, nuts, vegetables, peanuts, carrots, mashed potatoes, celery, walnuts, almonds, tomatoes, coriander and more. However, due to its small size, some foods need to be cut into pieces before processing. About Cleaning - Since it is easy to clean, it is recommended to rinse it directly with water. It is recommended to rinse it immediately after use to avoid food staying for too long and producing odors or sticking. The pull line cover can only be rinsed, while other parts can be cleaned in the dishwasher. However, since food-grade PC material is used, the temperature setting of the dishwasher should not exceed 65°C (149°F). Otherwise, it may deform. About 30cr13 (420J2) Blades - The blades are made of food-grade material and are martensitic stainless steel. They have high strength and durability, so you don’t have to worry about premature damage. Normal use for six to seven years is no problem. In addition, if there is any damage, we provide a one-year blade replacement service. Unique Design - Vegetable Chopper,adopts a cute duckbill shape design,the design is very in line with human mechanics,it is very labor-saving to use,and the quality is reliable. Safe Material - Made of PS+ABS+PP+S/S material, BPA FREE, durable, the blade is made of high-quality stainless steel blade, sharp.Be careful not to scratch when cleaning and keep it out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q1X-SfreL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RYKKZ","source_asin":"B0C4HKB9RK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4HKB9RK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4HKB9RK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
