window.products.push({"id":208665,"name":"Glass Tea Coffee Pot Spout Double Chamber Steeping Infuser Modern Chinese Kitchen (Clear, black - 25 OZ)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g298E4JQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No matter whether you care for tea, herbal teas or coffee, we’re sure you wouldn’t mind having a cup of hot drink during the busiest hours of working schedule. We have the solution. And the solution is this very ‘cutting edge’ kitchen tool. It looks stylish (all monochrome), easy to manage (no need to read three pages long instruction) and versatile (you can brew coffee, tea or some herbal concoction). But for all drinks there is a thing which you need to control very closely. It’s time. And we are talking about seconds here. Oversteeping is a sure way way to kill the taste and the aroma of the hot drink. To avoid this, we come to you with a pot that is not a magic wand but it’s close. This pot allows you to enjoy a cuppa whenever you want without brewing every time a tiny itsy-bitsy cup which requires time that is not always an option. Add to that clear walls that enable you to watch as your drink is getting ready and you've got yourself a perfect brewmaker! HOW DOES IT WORK?1. Place tea, herbal tea or coffee inside top compartment 2. Fill infuser with hot water 3. Steep to desired taste 4. Press button to release the brew tea into bottom chamber 5. Repeat steps as needed Tips for glassware use and care Use soft tissues or cloth to dry it – this will keep the glass shiny and prevent scratches in the surface of the glass. Fight water stains with baking soda or lemon and hot water. Do not expose glassware to sudden extremes of temperatures (placing hot pot in the freezer is a recipe for disaster). Don’t use metal spoons. It can lead to glass becoming weak.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g298E4JQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mueller Austria","source_asin":"B01N58Q21T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N58Q21T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N58Q21T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
