window.products.push({"id":208683,"name":"SunRose Electric Kettle SR906R, Stainless Steel Water Kettle 100% BPA Free 1.7L 1500W Fast Boiling for Coffee and Tea, Cordless with Auto Shut Off and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ASdnNDF8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The SunRose 1.7L Stainless Steel Electric Kettle 100% BPA free makes it easy to enjoy tea, coffee, milk, instant noodles, and baby food within a few minutes. It's your perfect electric kettle for everyday life. Features ● Stainless Steel material, 100% BPA free to provide healthy water for your family. ● 1.7L large capacity 1500W kettle can quickly boil water within 4-7 mins, effectively shortening waiting time. ● Automatic Shut-Off and Boil-Dry protection to ensure user safety, energy-saving and durability. ● The water level window makes checking water levels easier in the kettle. ● 360° rotational base, cordless design easy for filling and serving. Specifications 1. Color: Brushed 2. Material: Stainless Steel, BPA-Free Plastic 3. Capacity: 1.7L 4. Operating Power: 1500W 5. Voltage: 120V 6. Dimensions: 9.09 x 6.57 x 9.69 inches 7. Weight: 2.33LB 8. Boiling Time: 4~7 mins Package 1 x SunRose Electric Kettle 1 x 360 degrees cordless base 1 x User Manual Guaranteed and Service SunRose Stainless Steel Electric Kettle provides 1 years warranty and 7*24hrs services. If any questions, please feel free to contact us. How to Descale? ① Vinegar to removed scale: you can try to fill a pot with salty water and vinegar before going to bed at night. Till the next morning, brush it with detergent, and the scale will easily fall off. ② Lemon to removed scale: cut up one whole lemon, add the lemon and 500ml water to the kettle, boil, let stand for one hour until the water is cooled, then take a soft cloth or sponge to wipe down the inside. Pour out the water and rinse the kettle a few times until any taste of lemon is gone. ③ You can also replace the baking soda, boiled eggs or eggshells.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ASdnNDF8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunRose","source_asin":"B07Y1Z2Y7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y1Z2Y7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y1Z2Y7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
