window.products.push({"id":208942,"name":"Urban Vintage LA Moscow Mule Copper Mugs Set of 4 with Shot Glass & Recipe Book in Large Box, Premium Handcrafted Hammered 16 oz Real Copper Cups for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IEheQlSXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PURE COPPER MUGS: Just like the original Moscow Mule mugs from the 1940s, these goblets are 100 % copper and unlined. These are not chintzy mugs that are merely plated with copper. Ours are heavy traditional 22 gauge copper cups. With proper care they will last a lifetime. These fun and sparkly drinking vessels will add luster to your parties for years to come and will be great icebreakers at your next celebration. PREMIUM MOSCOW MULE GIFT SET WITH COPPER SHOT GLASS & MORE: Your stylish four pack includes: four shiny large copper mugs, one copper shot glass plus a convenient recipe book & care guide packaged in a stylish gift box. It will be a lovely addition to your home bar or kitchen. Order now. EXQUISITELY CRAFTED: These authentic Moscow Mule cups are handmade by skilled artisans. Made of food-grade copper and subjected to rigorous safety tests, they contain no inner chemical linings, tin, nickel, nor cheap alloys. We offer the very best. THICK WIDE COPPER HANDLE: Heavy-duty and welded, not riveted, so they won't ever leak or rust. Plus, since they are firmly attached, they stay put. Easy to clean, too. Thanks to copper's chill-conducting power, your Urban Vintage LA mugs will keep ANY cold drink! Perfect for drinking mixed drinks, soft drinks, juices, iced tea, water, mocktails, beer & wine & more. UNIQUE GIFT: Perfect for wedding, housewarming, hostess, new homeowner, apartment warming, holiday, Christmas, holiday, corporate, groomsmen party, bridal showers, anniversary gift for wife, anniversary gift for husband, seventh anniversary gift, gifts for men, gift for mixologists, real estate closing, retirement, and any occasion. QUALITY GUARANTEE: If you're not happy, return it for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IEheQlSXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Vintage LA","source_asin":"B019YQ3HSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019YQ3HSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019YQ3HSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
