window.products.push({"id":208960,"name":"Stephanie Imports Modern Minimalist Orange & Black Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mEhlmN2OL._AC_.jpg","description":"Designed with the modern home and office place in mind, these contemporary wall clocks challenge traditional design aesthetics by using materials and designs that are eye-catching and modern. Browse our growing collection of wall clocks to find your perfect match. Our collection of eye-catching wall clocks creates a contemporary focal point in any room you put them in, making them both a practical and stylish addition to your home. This clocks measures 11.5”X 11.5” and features a white FORESCOLOR* ecoboard with veneer dial that is 0.2” thick. The clock hands are made of orange and black polished acrylic, both of which are covered with a pineapple yellow circular disk. Operates with 1 AA battery which is not included. Wall clock is completely silent thanks to a special Silent Quartz Mechanism that features a continuous, high torque smooth sweep motion that completely eliminates any ticking noise which may distract or interrupt you or others in the room. Hanging hook on back of clock allows you to easily hang this on any nail, screw or wall hook. Is suitable for home or office use and also makes a great gift. Dial Material: FORESCOLOR Ecoboard With Veneer Color: Orange and Black Size: 11.5” X 11.5” Thickness: 0.2” Clock Hands Material: Polished Acrylic *FORESCOLOR is a range of engineered colored MDF boards that are durable and maintain appearance in tough environments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mEhlmN2OL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stephanie Imports","source_asin":"B07P9TTT49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9TTT49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9TTT49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
