window.products.push({"id":208985,"name":"Nature's Own 4 Tier Indian-Tiffin Stainless Steel Large Tiffin Lunch Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GGevZjKfL._AC_SL1482_.jpg","description":"Reducing the use of plastic in our daily lives is a huge step forward in saving the planet. In 2003 my family and I decided to pursue a plastic free lifestyle, one of the ways we did this was through the use of stainless steel Indian Tiffin boxes as opposed to plastic containers. These Indian Tiffin boxes were a huge success, we loved them so much, we decided to sell them online and have since become the world’s largest Indian-Tiffin Box seller! Save the planet and reduce plastic waste by using our 4 Tier Indian Tiffin! The 4 tier Indian Tiffin has been specifically developed for us. It is made of food grade stainless steel thus making it durable, long-lasting and versatile. This Indian Tiffin is perfect for picnics, school lunches and carrying snacks in an environmentally friendly. As well as being great for the environment the 4 Tier Indian Tiffin box is trendy and practical due to features such as the shorter foldaway handle. When complete the 4 tiffin tins stack up on top of each other and are sealed, through a simple locking mechanism, although they are not water tight, they do a pretty good job of keeping liquid in. Tiffin boxes originated in Mumbai, India, where they have been used for centuries and are still used today. The 4 Tier Indian Tiffin box is also dishwasher and freezer safe, and can be used directly on stoves or campfires. Join the Tiffin revolution, and the growing band of people taking their lunches into work in a trendy and environmentally friendly way!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GGevZjKfL._AC_SL1482_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nature's Own","source_asin":"B08T7N56N1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-208985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T7N56N1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T7N56N1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
